(MODULE 1: EXPLORATORY DATA ANALYSIS & FEATURE ENGINEERING) Tj T*
(1.1 Data Distributions & Summary Statistics: Mean, median, mode, IQR, variance,) Tj T*
(skewness, kurtosis, and boxplot anomaly detection.) Tj T*
(1.2 Missing Data & Outliers: MCAR vs MAR vs MNAR; Imputation techniques \(median, KNN,) Tj T*
(MICE\); Z-score and Tukey IQR outlier clipping.) Tj T*
(1.3 Feature Scaling & Encoding: Min-Max Normalization vs Standard Z-score) Tj T*
(Standardization; One-Hot Encoding vs Target Encoding vs Ordinal Encoding.) Tj T*
(1.4 Dimensionality Reduction: Principal Component Analysis \(PCA\), eigendecomposition) Tj T*
(of covariance matrix, scree plot and explained variance ratio.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MODULE 2: SUPERVISED LEARNING: REGRESSION & CLASSIFICATION) Tj T*
(2.1 Linear Models: Ordinary Least Squares \(OLS\) assumptions \(Gauss-Markov theorem\),) Tj T*
(multicollinearity, Variance Inflation Factor \(VIF\).) Tj T*
(2.2 Regularization: Ridge Regression \(L2 penalty\), Lasso Regression \(L1 penalty,) Tj T*
(sparse feature selection\), ElasticNet.) Tj T*
(2.3 Logistic Regression: Log-odds \(logit\) transformation, maximum likelihood) Tj T*
(estimation \(MLE\), Sigmoid activation, decision threshold tuning.) Tj T*
(2.4 Tree-Based Algorithms: Decision Trees \(Entropy, Gini Impurity, Information Gain\);) Tj T*
(Ensemble methods: Random Forests \(Bagging\), Gradient Boosted Trees \(XGBoost,) Tj T*
(LightGBM\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MODULE 3: MODEL EVALUATION & DIAGNOSTIC METRICS) Tj T*
(3.1 Classification Metrics: Confusion Matrix, Precision, Recall \(Sensitivity\),) Tj T*
(Specificity, F1-Score, Macro vs Weighted F1.) Tj T*
(3.2 Threshold Curves: Receiver Operating Characteristic \(ROC\) curve, Area Under the) Tj T*
(Curve \(AUC-ROC\), Precision-Recall \(PR\) Curve for imbalanced datasets.) Tj T*
(3.3 Cross-Validation: K-Fold, Stratified K-Fold \(for imbalanced classes\), Time-Series) Tj T*
(Purged Split, data leakage prevention.) Tj T*
(3.4 Bias-Variance Tradeoff: High bias \(underfitting\) vs High variance \(overfitting\),) Tj T*
(learning curves analysis, regularization tuning.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MODULE 4: TIME SERIES & UNSUPERVISED CLUSTERING) Tj T*
(4.1 Clustering Algorithms: K-Means clustering, WCSS Elbow method, Silhouette score) Tj T*
(analysis; Hierarchical clustering and Dendrograms; DBSCAN density clustering.) Tj T*
(4.2 Time Series Components: Trend, Seasonality, Cyclical, and Irregular/Noise) Tj T*
(components; Additive vs Multiplicative decomposition.) Tj T*
(4.3 Stationarity & ARIMA: Augmented Dickey-Fuller \(ADF\) test, Differencing,) Tj T*
(Autoregressive \(AR\), Moving Average \(MA\), ARIMA\(p,d,q\) modeling.) Tj T*
